      "The gate closes 30 minutes before the paper begins — 8:30 am for the 9 am shift, 2:30 pm for the 3 pm shift — and no candidate is admitted after that. The reporting time printed on the admit card is usually about 90 minutes before the shift, so plan to be at the centre at least an hour before gate closing to absorb frisking and document checks."
