  "intro": "The Meme Generator is a layer-based meme editor: the base image and every text or emoji caption live as separately positioned elements you drag with a mouse or a finger, stored as percentage coordinates so they stay put at any canvas size. Pressing Export rasterizes that live preview with html2canvas at scale 3 and downloads it as a PNG — three times the on-screen preview resolution, with nothing stamped on it. Images you upload are read locally by your browser's FileReader and held in the page rather than sent anywhere; the four built-in templates (Drake, Expanding Brain, Distracted Boyfriend, Batman Slap) load from imgflip's image CDN.",
